        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5306SPK, Modern Spoke Knobset with Urban Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Spoke Knob with Urban Modern Rose is a re-envisioning what a modern door knob can be. The Spoke knob deconstructs the concept of traditional door hardware by stripping away excess material, leaving a single spoke to bridge the body of the knob with its base. The Modern Spoke Knobset with Urban Rosette will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Choose from Emtek's modern finish color options. The Studio Brass Spoke Knob with Urban Modern Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-SPK-specifcation.gif?v=1704354535\" width=\"461\" height=\"242\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Spoke Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Spoke Knob with Urban Modern Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Spoke Knob and Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-SPK-specification.pdf?v=1704262417\"><b>Emtek Spoke Knob Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Spoke Knob with Urban Modern Rose",
                "description": "The Spoke Knob with Urban Modern Rose is a re-envisioning what a modern door knob can be. The Spoke knob deconstructs the concept of traditional door hardware by stripping away excess material, leaving a single spoke to bridge the body of the knob with its base. The Modern Spoke Knobset with Urban Rosette will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Choose from Emtek's modern finish color options. The Studio Brass Spoke Knob with Urban Modern Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
